<p>Hello <%= @resource.first_name %>,</p>

<p>A password reset was requested for your <%= @site_name %> account.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you did not request this, you can ignore the message. Your password will not change unless the link is used.</p>
